    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21f6716420076cbe4dae56e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我敲了一下隔壁房间的门，\n东商变革似乎还没有回来。\n于是我决定去找她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c96e52ead47214869ae4590a19112c3f600837247dc18e18b29a163c4a8006",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
