    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5d4a13dd6a11f0b08e7a2ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈哈哈！哇～使魔生气了！\n一点都不可怕～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23af5f628d877b74f31cc988aae9ac5ed453fd500b0584852f1bfbf820749482",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb35e312c3f6024458cb7a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在一起尽情玩乐、共进晚餐后，\n我才去泡澡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9f2a18914d4ea0d4e5d3814e080f33c7abb4a389ab96079f72efc1a5a8858d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37465af7ddd98bddf89bc2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……仔细想想，\n东商变革今天莫名听话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a428220a99fb6bd386a0514664553f8b5fe0efcb5db38330fb832fd81a16e8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:347c932a868e1ae12d6d8771",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是早起去搭电车，\n还是从学园前往车站的路上──",
      "source_fingerprint": "284df2989a39de2390b60726676e5fd0f261a4c4046a7b5f4878ceab3e37db9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e9285f239335291babd900",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甚至就连在几乎没有空位的电车里，\n她都没有大闹脾气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d556f056aa4bb2d8dcf91ca86ce2bed6c68b6aca0b2b083aa17a90f98837deb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5aea3bfd588877bb4ffa2cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且她看我睡着，不仅没有叫醒我，\n还自己一个人乖乖地去泡澡──\n回房间后也玩得很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92bb79453b53849a490bb4ef4bcd2fa5700a00197813d2a57de8dce800f9f143",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ca05485f6a394ad9390294",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当初抽奖时，\n她明明有说游乐园比温泉好玩，\n这次却主动说要来泡温泉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53675ef860c5f64332605f2b3db40a95f464569d3078979d9e9fac3c09234bd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a531c222fa53bb7ffa7276",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该不会她是在用她的方式慰劳我吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7705b17554ecc3f9e7ef0ad43d42c404eb6bb52b1da40b57effa74002d3c8f3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
